---
title: Memory Capture Agent Responsibilities
---
flowchart TB
    Turn([Every ordinary chat turn]) --> Model[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>reads only this message]
    Model --> Typed[Typed candidates<br/>name · interests · locality · facts]
    Typed -->|nothing worth saving| NoWrite[Nothing saved]
    Typed -->|classified| Facts[(Auto-saved memory facts<br/>no approval step)]
    Facts --> Project[Projection]
    Project --> Profile[(Scout profile:<br/>interests and home)]

    Rule[No persistence authority in the model itself.<br/>A question is not a fact.<br/>Another person's preference is not the user's.<br/>Nothing is inferred.<br/>A failed save costs only that one candidate.]
    Rule -.-> Model
    Rule -.-> Facts

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef model fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    classDef warning fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b78b20,color:#4d3900,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
    class Turn,NoWrite interface;
    class Typed,Project application;
    class Facts,Profile data;
    class Model model;
    class Rule warning;
